{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14103","headline":"苦哉行五首 五 · 戎昱","name":"苦哉行五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可汗奉亲诏，今月归燕山。\n忽如乱刀劒，搅妾心肠间。\n出户望北荒，迢迢玉门关。\n生人爲死别，有去无时还。\n汉月割妾心，胡风凋妾颜。\n去去断绝魂，呌天天不闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}